# Trial by Wind (outlands 194): completed by GM (TrialByWind_date 0), the fork by GM: the battlefield's entry holds for
# a completed quest (status >= accepted), and 32001's finish gives the title and the Whisper of Gales in any status (kept
# Lua quirk; battlefieldWin is not read). Agado-Pugado: available (a GM) at fame level 1 with the whisper: 70;
# completed by GM (date 0): 66, whose option 1 deletes and begins it; accepted with the whisper: 69. The win
# while available is #battlefield_available (a second entry in this flow would land in the won arena, which the char
# has not left).
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWind completed
keyitem TuningForkOfWind
login
trigger WP_Entrance                       # completed, the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill OGMIOS-3                             # the battlefield won, 32001 opens (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # completed: Heir of the Great Wind, the Whisper of Gales all the same
warp -16.5,7.8,-10.5 Rabao
quest Outlands.TrialByWind available
trigger Agado-Pugado                      # available, fame level 1, the whisper: 70
finish
quest Outlands.TrialByWind completed
trigger Agado-Pugado                      # completed, TrialByWind_date 0 behind: 66
finish option=1                           # the quest deleted and begun; the fork
trigger Agado-Pugado                      # accepted, the whisper: 69
finish option=4                           # the Bubbly Water: completed
